OL,3,GNEWSAHousing plan ditched after
OL,4,A'overwhelming' criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans earmarking land for more than
OL,7,F40,000 new homes have been thrown out
OL,8,Fafter thousands of responses were
OL,9,Freceived through a public consultation.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council's Local
OL,12,FPlan was discussed and rejected by its
OL,13,Fplanning policy committee on Monday.
OL,15,FThe Reform UK-led authority had
OL,16,Fproposed up to 47,300 new homes across
OL,17,Fthe area by 2043.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
