OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAHousing plan ditched after
OL,4,A'overwhelming' criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Arnull, leader of the council said
OL,7,Fthere had been an overwhelming
OL,8,Fobjection to a large number of
OL,9,Fallocations and added: "There's no
OL,10,Fpoint in doing a consultation if you
OL,11,Fdon't take the feedback on board."
